# Build output – the image builds its own inside the container
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/artifacts/
**/publish/
**/TestResults/

# VCS & IDE
.git/
.gitignore
**/.idea/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/*.user
**/*.DotSettings.user

# Docker files themselves (not needed inside the build context)
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*
**/compose*.y*ml
.dockerignore

# Secrets & local configuration – never bake into an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/secrets.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.key

# Local databases, logs, OS junk
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.sqlite
**/logs/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Docs
**/*.md
